1. Opens a file
2. Successfully locks with LOCK_EX | LOCK_NB, expects True
3. Opens a second handle, tries LOCK_EX | LOCK_NB, expects False (contention)
4. Unlocks first, expects True
5. Second can now lock, expects True
6. Unlock second

